'''Cat Base Mini''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]] increases attack power, range and Wave level. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is only available when rolling in either [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] (SEA) or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] (JP/WW) banners.

