==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat Base Jr.''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Cat Base Ultra''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cat Base Mini is capable of producing a lvl 3 [[Wave Attack]], making him able to extend his range further and clear peon swarms. Later on though, he is completely outclassed by [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]] due to his inferior stats, making him only viable early game.

==='''True Form'''===
True Form comes with only a slight increase of his performance. This change, however, still doesn't make this cat viable to use, as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]] still outclasses him. In addition to that, the price for this true form, 5 [[Catfruit|Epic Catfruit]], is too expensive for what he is and is better spent somewhere else.

