==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], [[Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Neneko]], [[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Gold Cat]], Cat Base Mini and [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] could only be unlocked when "Limited Edition" was part of the current pool.
*Cat Base Mini and Cat Base Jr. both have unused sprites of the wave effect from the default [[Cat Cannon]]. In-game, both of them instead use the same wave effect as every other unit.
**Cat Base Ultra doesn't have the unused wave effect, but it does have an unused [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Cat]] head present in its spritesheet.
*Even though he was part of the "Limited Edition" set, Cat Base Mini gained his [[True Form]] with the "Reinforcements" set in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]].

